  "interpretation": {
    "tire_offsets": "Original code copies xyz directly from ecar layout+0x10+16*i to visual object+0x78+16*i; fourth component is clamped to >=0.1, copied to visual radius array+0xb8, then cleared in vector. Wheel roll update divides input by that radius. Geometry mounting origin and final wheel matrix remain unrecovered.",
    "ride_height": "Original visual consumer loads ecar layout+0xfc then uses float32 0.0254 multiplication in FMADD at 0x802d6650. This establishes inches-to-metres conversion for this visual field, not all suspension attributes.",
    "physical_radius": "Separate original helper 0x80224268 computes tire specification diameter; caller 0x802d3df0 multiplies by 0.5. Driving specialist owns its independently verified transcription. Do not conflate with TireOffsets artwork radius.",
    "fe_compressions": "Values are original; semantic use/units not proven here."
  }
